### Export
### Routes: /api/export/*
###
### Exports return file downloads, not JSON. A single document comes back as
### markdown; folders and the full wiki come back as a .zip. Path params are
### catch-all and auto-normalized.

@docPath = getting-started
@folderPath = docs

### Export one document as markdown
GET {{apiUrl}}/export/document/{{docPath}}
# => 200 text/markdown (Content-Disposition: attachment)

### Export a folder as a zip archive
GET {{apiUrl}}/export/folder/{{folderPath}}
# => 200 application/zip

### Export the entire wiki as a zip archive
GET {{apiUrl}}/export/all
# => 200 application/zip

#############################################
### Error cases
#############################################

### Export a non-existent document
GET {{apiUrl}}/export/document/does-not-exist
